; Each trigger's arguments: A, X and Y for its action, and a condition: bit 7,
; the player (or a thrown object) must face direction bits 4-5; bit 6, the
; cell faced (or landed against) must be type bits 0-3. Triggers 0-15's are
; one field, 16-31's the next.
